[b]Version 0.1.0 — Initial release[/b]

Initial compatibility release for Just Goods, More Locations, and Global Historical RGOs.

Includes merged location-template changes that preserve More Locations' added locations while applying the agreed RGO compatibility decisions.

Clarified precedence: Just Goods' explicit RGO changes win at its fixed locations; Global Historical RGOs wins for the agreed conflicts and qualifying split locations; More Locations remains the base elsewhere.
